  "reasoning": "The defendants secretly stole crude oil from a state-owned oil field, using a stolen vehicle and an underground storage system, with the oil valued at several thousand yuan, which meets the criteria for theft of public or private property of a large amount. Although a fire occurred during the oil transfer, the facts do not indicate that the fire was set intentionally, so arson is not applicable. The appropriate charge is theft (盗窃).",
